{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2016-08", "window": 1, "start_date": 1470009600, "end_date": 1470614399, "month_true_total": 104, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:11:53 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "24749972", "author": {"steamid": "76561198070834062", "personaname": "Paranoidhawklet", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/paranoidhawklet/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 40, "playtime_forever": 7839, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6613, "last_played": 1699682714, "avatar": "5e45b30b2674efee9803c102236d9fe7c7e1b4ae"}, "language": "english", "review": "Beautiful game, 10/10. Probably my favorite roguelike of all time. Excellent combat. Unique and fun characters. \nSomewhat short, I've 100%'d it in a decently short time. Has a few problems but the low price more than makes up for it, great dev's I'm hoping for a sequal, because it would fix the few problems, like some of the bosses are weak, enemy variety is kinda limited along with level variety. Some of the items are useless without a ton of them, while some others are overpowered (Ceremonial dagger, im looking at you)\nAmazing game, definitely buy if you're interested", "timestamp_created": 1470522241, "timestamp_updated": 1470522241, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "24745805", "author": {"steamid": "76561198002274525", "personaname": "Vince", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/6ad5f46sd84f98as1vd9a58s14df/", "num_games_owned": 748, "num_reviews": 95, "playtime_forever": 3590, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3567, "last_played": 1604072057,